---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>ZEVRAN - Our Story</title>
    <meta name="description" content="ZEVRAN started with a simple idea: start small, but build something that lasts. Working closely with skilled manufacturers, we select and develop pieces that deserve to carry our name." />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-ivory text-espresso font-montserrat">
    <Header />
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-12 font-cormorant text-xl leading-relaxed fade-in">
      <p>ZEVRAN started with a simple idea: start small, but build something that lasts. Working closely with skilled manufacturers, we select and develop pieces that deserve to carry our name. Every order is a step forward. Every piece becomes part of someone's story.</p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
